[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Non ho nulla contro di voi, e la vostra relazione sentimentale...[p]
Ma sono il responsabile di questa aula, e non posso permettere che la preside se la prenda con me![p]
Quindi state li seduti buoni e quando sarete fuori di qui potrete fare come volete![p]
(Ugh... Mi sento un uomo di merda... Poveri ragazzi...)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
I have nothing against you, and your romantic relationship....[p]
But I am in charge of this classroom, and I can't let the principal take it out on me![p]
So sit there quietly, and when you're out of here you can do as you please![p]
(Ugh... I feel like a shit man... Poor guys...)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Я ничего не имею против ваших отношений...[p]
Но я отвечаю за этот класс и не хочу, чтобы директор наказала меня![p]
Так что тихо сидите здесь, а когда выйдете, делайте что хотите![p]
(Уф... Чувствую себя последним негодяем... Бедняги...)[p]
[_tb_end_text]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

