[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Merda...[p]
Quando andavo a scuola io, le ragazze non facevano queste cose![p]
Sono così invidioso![p]
Come vorrei trovare il modo di partecipare alla festa! EH EH EH!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Shit...[p]
When I was in school, girls didn't do these things![p]
I am so envious![p]
How I wish I could find a way to join the party! EH EH EH!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Чёрт...[p]
Когда я учился в школе, девушки такого не вытворяли![p]
Как же я завидую![p]
Вот бы и мне найти способ присоединиться к веселью! ХЕ-ХЕ-ХЕ!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

