[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ANGELA
Ehy!!![p]
I am the principal!!![p]
And my job here involves me having to decide what the teachers have to do![p]
So these two will come to your office every time they finish a class....[p]
And you will be directly responsible for the quality of their behavior!!![p]
Clear?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
